#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Review artifact helpers for Scherzo dogfood workflows.

This script is intentionally outside the Scherzo runtime. It provides
no-side-effect helpers for staged code-review artifacts: inspect a PR or local
diff, generate a structured ReviewBrief artifact, run manual legacy specialist
lanes for validation fixtures, synthesize findings, write a final review
artifact, and execute local preflight/smoke suites. Production implementation
workflows use native Scherzo agent lane steps, not script-level lane backends.
"""

